ータが取得でき次第、ここに自動で表示されます。</div><div class=\"nhead\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(21年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"81.9\" width=\"320\" height=\"15.299999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,90.9 9.1,85.8 14.2,86.4 19.3,84.8 24.5,85.1 29.6,87.4 34.7,87.4 39.8,87.0 44.9,88.6 50.0,88.3 55.1,81.6 60.3,78.4 65.4,75.2 70.5,71.4 75.6,60.6 80.7,74.9 85.8,47.2 91.0,22.6 96.1,30.0 101.2,12.8 106.3,45.6 111.4,55.5 116.5,59.6 121.6,64.7 126.8,68.9 131.9,55.8 137.0,48.8 142.1,41.1 147.2,39.5 152.3,59.3 157.4,49.4 162.6,45.6 167.7,44.0 172.8,42.4 177.9,48.8 183.0,55.2 188.1,65.7 193.2,56.8 198.4,48.5 203.5,48.5 208.6,56.1 213.7,55.2 218.8,45.0 223.9,57.4 229.0,51.7 234.2,52.3 239.3,50.4 244.4,48.8 249.5,45.3 254.6,38.6 259.7,33.2 264.9,38.6 270.0,37.3 275.1,37.0 280.2,37.3 285.3,35.7 290.4,37.6 295.5,42.4 300.7,48.5 305.8,49.7 310.9,45.6 316.0,57.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 102.9 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d